     <actual>
      <location ref="298"></location>
      <dimension name="TBD" value="TBD"></dimension>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transfer of funds remains a key challenge for the ERM II. Disbursements from the EU to the AUC have been relatively quicker but experienced some delays for the release of the second tranche due to insufficient expenditure reporting.The transfer of funds to the Regional Economic Councils ECOWAS and IGAD have been slow. The reasons include slow bureaucratic procedures of the AUC and the fact that the transfers include bank accounts outside the AUC structure.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
